Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:32.65,italics,Sonia,0,0,0,,Oh, Vincent!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.65,0:01:34.49,italics,Sonia,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.49,0:01:36.07,italics,Vincent,0,0,0,,No, we mustn't, Miss Sonia!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.07,0:01:38.57,italics,Vincent,0,0,0,,My betrothed is still waiting \Nfor me in the West...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.49,0:01:45.50,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(37,290)\fad(317,521)\fscx80}Berlint in Love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.70,0:01:41.53,italicstop,Sonia,0,0,0,,But your parents decided \Non her, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.53,0:01:43.74,italicstop,Sonia,0,0,0,,I'll make you forget her!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.87,0:01:46.25,italicstop,Vincent,0,0,0,,No, we mustn't, Miss Sonia!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.25,0:01:47.67,italics,Vincent,0,0,0,,I can't breathe...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.55,0:02:00.68,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Oh, Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.68,0:02:04.39,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,I'm nearby because I was shopping. \NCan I come over right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.39,0:02:06.73,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,What? I can? Thank you! I'll be right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.60,0:02:09.52,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Good day, Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.52,0:02:12.44,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Are you alone?! You're not alone, are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.44,0:02:15.94,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Becky, are you actually \NShwoop-man, who could teleport?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.82,0:02:19.99,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Today's the day I finally \Nmeet my precious Loid
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.99,0:02:22.12,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,and propose that we begin courtship!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.12,0:02:24.62,italics,Martha,0,0,0,,You mustn't commit adultery, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.08,0:02:28.71,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa, Becky's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.75,0:02:31.50,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey there. Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.58,0:02:34.38,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,My precious Loid in the flesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.05,0:02:38.63,main,Martha,0,0,0,,Come, now. Introduce yourself, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.88,0:02:43.93,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Um, um... H-H-Hello. \NThank you for having me over.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.64,0:02:48.39,main,Martha,0,0,0,,I'm sorry we came over \Nunannounced, Mr. Forger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.39,0:02:50.27,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Oh, it's no problem at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.73,0:02:53.98,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm sure my daughter is happy \Nto have a friend over.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.77,0:02:56.78,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hello, Miss Becky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.78,0:02:59.86,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Miss Becky... Miss Becky... \NMiss Becky... Miss Becky...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.40,0:03:03.41,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Thank you for always being such \Ngood friends with my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.74,0:03:09.37,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Asherishk, tic-tac-toe, triangle, \Nsmiley old guy, steam, heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.71,0:03:11.04,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Some kind of code?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.00,0:03:16.71,main,Martha,0,0,0,,Come, now, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.71,0:03:20.38,main,Martha,0,0,0,,It's quite rude to roll around on \Nthe floor at someone else's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.63,0:03:22.26,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Love...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.05,0:03:26.14,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya's seen someone like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.18,0:03:26.89,top,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\b1\fs40\an7\c&HF3D3F4&\3c&HD15AE9&\4c&HD24BF3&\pos(30,10)}Wuv
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.31,0:03:30.77,main,Martha,0,0,0,,Now, behave yourself, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.77,0:03:33.06,main,Martha,0,0,0,,I will come pick you up \Nwhen it's time to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.90,0:03:37.52,main,Martha,0,0,0,,Please look after my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.19,0:03:39.11,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.65,0:03:46.08,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,The way her attendant carries herself...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.08,0:03:48.45,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,She's clearly a former soldier \Nwho's seen countless battlefields.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.45,0:03:50.20,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I guess that's to be expected \Nof the Blackbells.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.21,0:03:55.46,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Wanna explore Anya's home?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.46,0:03:58.59,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Well, I guess this is my first \Ntime actually coming inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.88,0:04:00.71,main,Anya,0,0,0,,This is the living room!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.71,0:04:03.88,main,Becky,0,0,0,,What? This isn't just the storage \Nspace by your front door?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.55,0:04:08.56,main,Anya,0,0,0,,This is Anya's room!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.56,0:04:11.81,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Oh, this is even more compact \Nthan my little Wiesel's doghouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.81,0:04:13.27,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Isn't it hard to breathe in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.52,0:04:16.36,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Let's stop exploring.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.36,0:04:17.61,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.52,0:04:20.82,main,Becky,0,0,0,,By the way, where's the wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.82,0:04:22.82,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama is out walking Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.82,0:04:24.31,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,This is my chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.78,0:04:27.12,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Oh, my precious Loid!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.12,0:04:30.08,main,Loid,0,0,0,,We mustn't, Miss Becky! I have a wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.08,0:04:32.71,main,Becky,0,0,0,,But your parents decided on \Nthis marriage, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.71,0:04:34.42,sign_13319_178__But_then_John_r,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(312,1)\pos(45,295)\fs15}Completely\N Unfounded
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.87,0:04:35.91,main,Loid,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.91,0:04:38.96,main,Becky,0,0,0,,I'll use my charms to make \Nyou forget about her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.96,0:04:41.01,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Oh, Miss Becky!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.93,0:04:53.77,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Becky's gonna become Anya's mama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.44,0:04:58.15,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,I'm sure Anya would be happy \Nif I were her mama, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.65,0:05:01.23,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Let's move somewhere much bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.23,0:05:02.65,main,Anya,0,0,0,,A castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.86,0:05:06.20,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Come, Anya. Let's head to \Nschool together. By helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.20,0:05:07.53,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.53,0:05:09.99,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Our meals will be prepared \Nby world-class chefs daily.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.99,0:05:10.99,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.99,0:05:12.04,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Yum.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.24,0:05:15.33,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Our attendants will help with \Nall the annoying stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.33,0:05:17.54,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Let's go out and play.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.54,0:05:18.92,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.80,0:05:24.55,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,She brings up good points!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.09,0:05:26.68,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.68,0:05:30.55,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm gonna side with Becky for just a \Nbit for the sake of world-class chefs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.18,0:05:34.35,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa! You should play with us, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.48,0:05:37.65,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Nice assist, Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.05,0:05:39.90,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Er, play?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.90,0:05:43.03,main,Becky,0,0,0,,W-W-W-We can just chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.90,0:05:46.86,main,Becky,0,0,0,,U-Um... Um... M-My...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.86,0:05:48.99,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Mwy name is Becky Blackbell!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.57,0:05:51.74,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hm? Yes, I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.20,0:05:55.53,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,World-class chefs! World-class chefs!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.75,0:05:58.21,main,Loid,0,0,0,,The Blackbells are quite famous,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.21,0:06:01.54,main,Loid,0,0,0,,so of course I knew about you even before \Nyou and Anya ended up in the same class.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.00,0:06:04.00,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,As an important source of information.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.00,0:06:06.01,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,He's known about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.34,0:06:10.14,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I have various routes to obtain my intel, \Nbut there might be some useful information
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.14,0:06:12.89,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I can gain from the Blackbells' \Ndaughter, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.89,0:06:14.26,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I guess I'll chat with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.06,0:06:17.02,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa immediately goes into work mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:19.14,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Is your father well?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.56,0:06:22.90,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I heard he's been busy with the \Nrestructuring going on in the industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.90,0:06:25.90,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Um, yes... But my papa is nice,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.90,0:06:28.32,main,Becky,0,0,0,,so whenever he has a day off, \Nhe always plays with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.65,0:06:30.86,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Last time, we went to the movies!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.86,0:06:32.87,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Next time, I'd love to go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.87,0:06:35.04,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Oh, really? What did you go see?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.04,0:06:37.41,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Did you go to the theater by the river?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.41,0:06:40.29,main,Loid,0,0,0,,There are a lot of great \Nrestaurants around there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.83,0:06:43.09,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,The time her father is off from work,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.09,0:06:45.42,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,the range of his activities, \Nhis habits, what he likes to eat...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.42,0:06:47.42,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Plenty of potentially useful information.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.72,0:06:52.01,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Oh, um... We saw a romance...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.01,0:06:55.43,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,H-He's trying to find out my preferences?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.43,0:06:56.56,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,He even mentioned restaurants...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.56,0:06:59.14,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Wait, did he just ask me out?! \NDid he ask me out just now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.14,0:07:00.69,main,Loid,0,0,0,,You two must be really close.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.19,0:07:03.02,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Do you go out with your family often?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.02,0:07:05.73,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Do you and your parents have \Nfun together at home, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.73,0:07:07.78,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Currently, there's nothing suggesting
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.78,0:07:10.32,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,that Blackbell Heavy Industries \Nis involved any plans for war,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.32,0:07:14.07,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,but it wouldn't hurt to obtain some \Ninformation for the future just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.07,0:07:16.62,main,Becky,0,0,0,,P-P-P-Papa loves to play chess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.62,0:07:19.33,main,Becky,0,0,0,,I don't understand it at all, \Nbut he always makes me play.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.00,0:07:22.12,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Uh, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.58,0:07:25.21,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,He's asking so much about my family!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.21,0:07:27.55,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Could it be that my precious \NLoid is preparing for the future
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.55,0:07:29.76,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,and planning a serious courtship with me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.05,0:07:33.01,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,He's looking at me oh so intently!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.51,0:07:34.64,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,She's wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.47,0:07:38.31,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I've returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.31,0:07:39.60,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.02,0:07:42.59,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh? Welcome, Miss Becky!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.40,0:07:46.11,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Here comes the final boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.44,0:07:49.07,top,Anya,0,0,0,,World-class chefs! World-class chefs!\N World-class chefs!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.11,0:07:49.07,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Right when my precious Loid \Nwas actively pursuing me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.90,0:07:53.66,main,Becky,0,0,0,,H-Hello, Mrs. Forger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.66,0:07:55.20,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, you're so adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.20,0:07:58.08,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Behold, Becky! This is our Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.08,0:07:59.45,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.91,0:08:03.08,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,My precious Loid's heart is \Nstarting to lean more toward me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.08,0:08:04.38,top,Anya,0,0,0,,Behold, Becky!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.54,0:08:05.29,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Just one more push, Becky!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.29,0:08:07.67,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,You need to give it all you've \Ngot right here and now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.71,0:08:12.05,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Use what you've learned from your dramas!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.18,0:08:14.59,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, Loid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.34,0:08:17.85,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I bought the ingredients for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.85,0:08:19.18,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Thanks, Yor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.18,0:08:22.31,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,She's showing off how domestic she is?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.31,0:08:24.02,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Hmph, how naïve.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.02,0:08:27.06,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,That's not enough to win \Nmy precious Loid's heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.06,0:08:30.15,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa and Mama are already married, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.65,0:08:33.90,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,As Jonathan from {\i0}Berlint in Love{\i1} said,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.90,0:08:37.87,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,even when men get married, \Nthey want their partners to be real women.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.75,0:08:43.87,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Huh? That wasn't much of a reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.87,0:08:45.67,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Maybe I didn't bat my eyelashes enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.67,0:08:48.75,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,But Tommy said it's really sexy \Nwhen a girl lets down her hair
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.75,0:08:50.55,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,or puts it back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.43,0:09:03.31,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I know Miss Becky has been really \Nlooking forward to meeting you, Loid,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.31,0:09:05.02,main,Yor,0,0,0,,so she must be very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.02,0:09:06.94,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Perhaps this is how she expresses that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.94,0:09:08.44,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Ah... right...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.65,0:09:13.65,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I've made us some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.45,0:09:17.66,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Why don't you have a seat over there, Loid?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.41,0:09:23.58,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,My precious Loid is right next \Nto me! He's right next to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.71,0:09:30.42,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Showing mercy by having him sit next \Nto me? The missus must be going crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.42,0:09:34.01,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,I know. She must've admitted defeat \Nafter seeing my hair attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.01,0:09:35.09,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,This is your chance, Becky!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.09,0:09:36.34,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Go all in!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.34,0:09:39.30,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,She doesn't seem to be feeling well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.30,0:09:42.85,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Um, my precious Loid, about what \Nyou were saying earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.02,0:09:47.06,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Are you interested in my family?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.06,0:09:47.98,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,"My precious"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.31,0:09:51.32,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry. I didn't mean anything by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.32,0:09:53.07,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I may have asked too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.44,0:09:56.70,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I figured she wouldn't notice since she's \Na child, but I may have gone too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.74,0:10:00.32,main,Becky,0,0,0,,What?! You mean you were just \Nplaying games with my heart?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.54,0:10:06.41,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:09.29,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Yor's going to get the wrong idea somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.63,0:10:14.63,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, Loid! He must have been playing \Nwith Miss Becky before I got home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.63,0:10:15.80,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,He's so kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.67,0:10:18.84,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Look at her smiling like \Nshe's won this round.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.84,0:10:20.68,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,She's so sure she's won!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.68,0:10:23.06,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Do I really not have a chance with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.31,0:10:25.02,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Are my chefs going to lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.02,0:10:27.14,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Fine, I'm going for broke!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.14,0:10:30.52,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,I'll use the final attack that \NPenelope used on Tommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.61,0:10:36.19,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Oh, dear. I think I'm getting a little drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.15,0:10:39.57,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Uh, it's tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.36,0:10:41.82,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,According to{\i0} Berlint in Love{\i1},
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.82,0:10:44.58,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,this is a taboo move that 100% \Nmakes the guy fall for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.58,0:10:46.58,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,There's no turning back now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.58,0:10:48.25,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,This is war, missus!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.42,0:10:53.21,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Er, Yor, this isn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.21,0:10:54.34,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.63,0:10:57.17,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I've somehow managed to put \Nalcohol in a child's drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.17,0:10:58.34,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Whatever shall I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.34,0:10:59.59,main,Loid,0,0,0,,No, really. It's just tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.59,0:11:01.93,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Did I steep the tea leaves for too long?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.60,0:11:05.09,main,Yor,0,0,0,,The hospital! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.09,0:11:06.39,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Let's go to the hospital!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.39,0:11:07.60,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.02,0:11:09.48,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yor?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.89,0:11:12.86,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Miss Becky?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.86,0:11:13.61,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Do you feel nauseous?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.61,0:11:16.86,main,Becky,0,0,0,,I'm fine! I'm fine, really! Just put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.86,0:11:20.07,main,Yor,0,0,0,,You mustn't underestimate \Nacute alcohol poisoning!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.07,0:11:21.78,main,Becky,0,0,0,,No, really! It's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.66,0:11:32.08,main,Yor,0,0,0,,But I'm not sure exactly what kind \Nof doctor should see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.08,0:11:34.04,main,Becky,0,0,0,,You should probably go \Nto the emergency room!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.76,0:11:41.43,main,Yor,0,0,0,,We're almost there! Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.43,0:11:42.84,main,Yor,0,0,0,,You'll die if you fall asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.84,0:11:44.51,main,Becky,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.51,0:11:48.18,main,Yor,0,0,0,,"Hee-hee-hoo!" Like that! "Hee-hee-hoo!"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.18,0:11:49.73,main,Becky,0,0,0,,That's not it, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.11,0:11:51.69,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Please wait, ma'am...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.69,0:11:53.10,main,Becky,0,0,0,,That's not it... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.10,0:11:56.11,main,Becky,0,0,0,,I was just lying because I wanted \Nto date my precious Loid!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.11,0:11:57.52,main,Becky,0,0,0,,I'm not drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.73,0:11:58.65,main,Yor,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.36,0:12:02.53,main,Becky,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry! I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.16,0:12:06.53,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm so happy you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.83,0:12:07.79,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.66,0:12:10.00,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Can you stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.41,0:12:12.75,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Y-You're not going to yell at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.75,0:12:15.29,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Why would I? You're safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.29,0:12:18.09,main,Becky,0,0,0,,No, I mean about my precious Loid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.09,0:12:22.34,main,Yor,0,0,0,,It makes me happy to hear \Nthat Loid is so loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.01,0:12:24.80,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I mean, he is quite lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.14,0:12:28.56,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Sh... She has such a huge heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.97,0:12:30.31,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,She's okay with infidelity?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.60,0:12:32.77,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm the one who should be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.77,0:12:35.31,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I took you this far because I panicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.31,0:12:37.56,main,Becky,0,0,0,,No, that's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.56,0:12:41.57,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm such a failure compared to Loid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.52,0:12:45.82,main,Becky,0,0,0,,B-But my precious Loid chose you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.74,0:12:49.83,main,Becky,0,0,0,,How did you shoot an arrow \Nthrough his heart?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.83,0:12:50.95,main,Becky,0,0,0,,I want to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.95,0:12:52.91,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Shoot him... huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.91,0:12:55.45,main,Yor,0,0,0,,But I haven't shot Loid!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.75,0:12:58.54,main,Yor,0,0,0,,And I don't use a bow and arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.54,0:12:59.29,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.29,0:13:00.42,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.42,0:13:01.26,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.42,0:13:08.26,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, um, the reason Loid chose me is, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.26,0:13:11.47,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I can't tell her that our priorities aligned.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.93,0:13:16.06,main,Yor,0,0,0,,My memories are a bit fuzzy, \Nbut I believe he's told me before...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.06,0:13:18.02,main,Yor,0,0,0,,It's because I'm strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.02,0:13:19.65,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Because you're strong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.65,0:13:22.74,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,M-My precious Loid prefers strong women?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.74,0:13:24.86,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,I mean, his wife is definitely really strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.86,0:13:26.49,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Well, more like she's built very tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.49,0:13:28.87,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey! There they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.28,0:13:30.49,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Becky!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.50,0:13:36.00,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Becky, you forgot your bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.29,0:13:41.42,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,My precious Loid was so worried \Nthat he came looking for me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.42,0:13:42.46,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Your bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.76,0:13:46.63,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Strong... I need to somehow \Nshow him that I'm strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.63,0:13:47.89,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,There must be something...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.51,0:13:50.01,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.60,0:13:55.23,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Oh, I suddenly feel like \NI want to throw down a hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.23,0:13:56.64,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,What the heck kind of feeling is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.64,0:13:58.81,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I really don't understand \Nthe children of rich people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.11,0:14:03.03,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Mister, I'd like to play this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.23,0:14:06.20,main,Owner,0,0,0,,Wha? You gonna be able to pay, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.74,0:14:16.04,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Chefs! Chefs! Chefs! Chefs! Chefs! Chefs!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.24,0:14:13.74,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.04,0:14:16.71,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Che—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.75,0:14:19.54,main,Owner,0,0,0,,You give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:21.75,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,I'm a weak woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.75,0:14:24.17,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,I'm such a weak and awful woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.17,0:14:26.05,main,Yor,0,0,0,,A-Are you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.30,0:14:29.55,main,Becky,0,0,0,,My precious Loid will never \Nnotice me if I'm like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.55,0:14:37.43,sign_13319_178__But_then_John_r,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H6F7271&\3c&HF7FAF8&}Super Earpick\N Ultra Nail Clippers\N Hyper Toothbrush
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.80,0:14:37.43,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Aha. Miss Becky must've wanted to give \Nthe top prize to Loid as a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.77,0:14:39.60,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm going to borrow this for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.36,0:14:43.44,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Hup.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.86,0:14:55.54,italicstop,Game,0,0,0,,First place! First place! First place! \NFirst place! First place! First place!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.37,0:14:53.53,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I-I did it...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.53,0:14:55.54,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I couldn't control my strength again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.33,0:14:58.41,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,So this is strength...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.75,0:15:02.46,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,My precious Loid is staring \Nso intently at his wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.46,0:15:05.87,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,So that {\i0}is{\i1} it! He really \Ndoes prefer strong women!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.84,0:15:07.84,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yor...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.84,0:15:09.51,main,Yor,0,0,0,,You've got the wrong idea, Loid!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.51,0:15:12.63,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I used to be the apprentice of \Na professional hammer user!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.63,0:15:14.51,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Just look at his beautiful, round eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.51,0:15:16.89,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,He's definitely in love with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.89,0:15:21.10,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,I guess I'm no match for you, missus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.10,0:15:21.94,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.94,0:15:26.07,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Your heart is as vast as the sky, \Nand you're stronger than the earth itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.07,0:15:28.19,main,Becky,0,0,0,,You're the perfect lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.32,0:15:31.91,main,Becky,0,0,0,,I want to become your apprentice!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.91,0:15:34.03,main,Becky,0,0,0,,I want to become strong like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.03,0:15:36.74,main,Yor,0,0,0,,L-Like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.75,0:15:41.87,main,Yor,0,0,0,,All right. Then let's train together!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.87,0:15:43.67,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.29,0:15:47.17,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,And then, one day, \NI'll make my precious Loid...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.05,0:15:53.64,main,Martha,0,0,0,,I've come to get you, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.64,0:15:54.60,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.01,0:15:59.52,main,Yor,0,0,0,,No, Miss Becky. You need to \Ntwist your hips more! Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.93,0:16:00.89,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.31,0:16:02.14,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.39,0:16:03.10,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.10,0:16:04.44,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Ah, déjà vu...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.56,0:16:04.44,top,Yor,0,0,0,,Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.44,0:16:07.07,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Yeah, Mama's way more fun to be around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.73,0:16:05.65,top,Becky,0,0,0,,Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.65,0:16:06.57,top,Yor,0,0,0,,Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.57,0:16:07.27,top,Becky,0,0,0,,Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.90,0:16:09.90,sign_8129_90_3_Days_Later,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(575,20)\fs20}Berlint General Hospital,\N Thursday
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.90,0:16:13.66,top,Nurse A,0,0,0,,You're on vacation starting \Ntomorrow, aren't you, Dr. Forger?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.40,0:16:18.41,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(445,270)\fad(530,517)\fscx52}Nightfall's Daily Life
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.66,0:16:15.57,top,Loid,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.57,0:16:18.91,top,Psychiatrist D,0,0,0,,Nah, you always work \Ntoo much, so it's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.91,0:16:20.70,main,Psychiatrist D,0,0,0,,Have a great time and relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.70,0:16:25.17,main,Nurse B,0,0,0,,I'm so jealous, sir. Tell me\N all about it next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.42,0:16:28.30,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Sure. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.84,0:16:32.80,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for giving you extra work while \NI'm gone, but I appreciate all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.80,0:16:34.84,sign_31457_339_The_medicine__po,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,290)\bord1.5\c&HFFFFFC&\3c&H000000&\fs34}WISE Safe House G
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.34,0:16:38.18,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,That's the basic rundown of this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.18,0:16:40.02,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Do you have any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.02,0:16:41.85,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,No, I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.43,0:16:44.56,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Nightfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.15,0:16:46.36,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Oh, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.02,0:16:48.94,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Take a look at this, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.15,0:16:56.66,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I was planning to give that mission to \NTwilight once he got back from vacation,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.66,0:16:58.33,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,but things have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.66,0:17:00.33,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Sorry, but this is urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.33,0:17:02.62,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Will you be able to do \Nsome additional tasks?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.62,0:17:04.87,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Of course, I'll be splitting the \Ntasks with other agents, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.46,0:17:08.67,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,No, I'll do all of this myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.25,0:17:14.72,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I appreciate your dedication, \Nbut you have your own mission, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.22,0:17:18.55,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I don't intend to destroy \Nall of you with overwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.14,0:17:23.27,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,But I don't believe anyone other \Nthan me can fulfill these tasks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.81,0:17:28.61,main,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Fine. But don't push yourself too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.16,0:17:42.04,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Agent Twilight is WISE's number one spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.17,0:17:55.38,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,None of the missions that a spy of \Nhis caliber is tasked with are easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.26,0:18:01.26,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,But for me, this is a huge opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.91,0:18:26.58,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Twilight has taught me so very much...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.54,0:18:30.79,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,The techniques of a spy, \Nhow to present myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.38,0:18:35.84,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I use all those skills to the \Nfullest to complete my missions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.35,0:18:45.43,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,And whenever I perfectly \Nexecute my missions...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.29,0:19:10.21,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I'm going to take the role of his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.21,0:19:18.59,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Yes! Now I'm sure Twilight \Nwill finally figure out
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.59,0:19:21.80,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,that I'm the one best \Nsuited to be his partner!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.51,0:19:26.47,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.14,0:19:34.15,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,This is still not enough to \Nsecure complete victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.15,0:19:36.61,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,In order to defeat Yor Briar...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.64,0:19:39.78,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,In order to become Mrs. Forger...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.78,0:19:40.95,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I need more!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.79,0:19:47.83,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,More!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.17,0:19:53.17,italics,Nightfall,0,0,0,,More!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.30,0:20:03.30,sign_8129_90_3_Days_Later,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(575,20)\fs20}Monday:\N Morning
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.30,0:20:06.22,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Those are all of the documents concerning \Nyour patients while you were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.22,0:20:07.39,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.39,0:20:10.64,italics,Nightfall internal,0,0,0,,Three days later and Twilight is \Nas lovely as ever. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.64,0:20:14.61,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,How was your vacation? Any changes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.02,0:20:15.25,italicstop,Nightfall internal,0,0,0,,Like maybe finding a huge flaw \Nin your current wife for Strix?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.81,0:20:18.73,italics,Loid internal,0,0,0,,There were a handful of troublesome \Nthings like Anya being selfish
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.73,0:20:21.07,italics,Loid internal,0,0,0,,and the whole bomb threat, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.40,0:20:23.32,main,Loid,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.32,0:20:24.62,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.62,0:20:25.28,main,Nightfall internal,0,0,0,,Tch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.82,0:20:27.66,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.66,0:20:30.41,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Were there any changes while I was gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.41,0:20:33.83,italics,Nightfall internal,0,0,0,,I worked very hard on my missions \Nso I can be a woman you'd admire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.83,0:20:36.38,italics,Nightfall internal,0,0,0,,Next time, I'm going to \Nbeat that woman, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.38,0:20:38.67,italics,Nightfall internal,0,0,0,,So you should choose me to be your wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.67,0:20:40.42,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:41.72,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.72,0:20:45.97,flashback,Loid,0,0,0,,Nightfall did?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.43,0:20:47.39,flashback,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.72,0:20:51.10,flashback,Sylvia,0,0,0,,She was determined to take \Non all the tasks herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.10,0:20:53.56,flashback,Sylvia,0,0,0,,She did excellent work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.98,0:20:57.90,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,To think that Nightfall would take \Nover for me while I was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.90,0:21:00.11,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm sure she had her own missions, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.40,0:21:02.90,sign_13319_178__But_then_John_r,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H7B5947&\3c&HEDE7DF&\fs30}Souvenirs
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.36,0:21:06.45,main,Loid,0,0,0,,By the way... I had some extra souvenirs \Nleft after handing them out to everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.45,0:21:07.66,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Do you want them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.91,0:21:14.54,sign_13319_178__But_then_John_r,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H7B5947&\3c&HEDE7DF&\fs30}Souvenirs
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.42,0:21:17.54,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,She's glaring at me so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.54,0:21:19.67,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait, why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.67,0:21:21.53,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.26,0:21:23.76,main,Nightfall,0,0,0,,Please excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.85,0:21:42.73,italicstop,Nightfall internal,0,0,0,,I wuv you! I wuv you! I wuv you! \NI wuv you! I wuv you! I wuv you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.86,0:21:43.85,main,Nurse B,0,0,0,,I figured that was my only chance \Nto say anything, so I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.36,0:21:45.64,main,Nurse A,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.64,0:21:46.98,main,Nurse A,0,0,0,,Oh, Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.23,0:21:48.90,main,Nurses A and B,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.25,0:21:59.92,top,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS\b1\fs40\an8\c&HEFE9FA&\3c&HA96CF1&\4c&HD24BF3&\shad0\bord4}I wuv him
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.14,0:22:18.04,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,The bright crimson that \Nappears right before my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.75,0:22:27.94,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Stretches approximately 40,000 kilometers
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.06,0:22:35.79,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Our wounds that inch closer behind us
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.79,0:22:40.87,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Make us wander even more \Nwhen we're already lost
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.87,0:22:45.46,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,The unseeable, scentless, unmistakable future
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.46,0:22:47.39,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Stabbed me in the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.39,0:22:48.55,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.55,0:22:58.09,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Let me stay by your side tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.09,0:23:05.81,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Just for tonight, I'm going to be serious
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.10,0:23:09.68,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Come closer to me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.68,0:23:11.97,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Even the future we prayed for
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.97,0:23:14.00,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Has a different path
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:17.54,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,My dear
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.09,0:23:21.60,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Our malice for each other
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.60,0:23:24.88,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Might just get to us
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.25,0:23:29.48,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Or maybe not
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.93,0:23:39.93,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(470,285)\fscx53}Part of the Family
